{"id":"wb-1-7","name":"武昌起义军政府旧址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"武昌起义军政府旧址","text":"武昌起义军政府旧址，为中华民国军政府鄂军都督府原所在地，位于中国武汉市武昌区蛇山南麓的武珞路1号，阅马场的北端。现辟为辛亥革命武昌起义纪念馆，为国家一级博物馆、国家4A级旅游景区、全国爱国主义教育示范基地。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%AD%A6%E6%98%8C%E8%B5%B7%E4%B9%89%E5%86%9B%E6%94%BF%E5%BA%9C%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80","revisionId":95315556,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95315556","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/ce77056ea0e95a9af78273a0.jpg","title":"WuchangUprising.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:WuchangUprising.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/48/WuchangUprising.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Mongol","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/","caption":"​1911年武昌起義後在武漢設的政府所在地。旗子是鐵血十八星旗。","width":320,"height":240}}